    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>The highrider revolts cost Orbital Air its dominance, but nobody builds better armor for vacuum. The Neo Spider is a cost-cut version of older models, sold mostly to highrider stations and to anyone else with deep enough pockets. Orbital Air denies the rumors of cloaking and netrunning variants.</em></p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 44,124eb (Luxury)<br><strong>Frame / Shell:</strong> Sigma / TUp (+1 MOVE) Hybrid Metalgear®<br><strong>Stats:</strong> 25 HP • 16 SP • BODY 12<br><strong>Onboard weapons:</strong> Malorian Arms 3570 Hailstorm w/ Short Barrel ×2, Militech M-156E Laramie w/ Long Tube ×2, Kendachi M-35 Mono-Wakizashi<br><strong>Onboard cyberware:</strong> Low Light/Infrared/UV, Radio Communicator, Targeting Scope, Zero Gravity Thrusters</p><p>One pilot. The suit's stats modify the pilot's; see the Item Compendium, Power Armor.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Power Armor</small></p>",
      "alias": "",
      "history": "",
      "notes": ""
    }
